        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n23 Abbeyfield, Ballaghaderreen, Co. Roscommon, F45 HK24\nSuperb Four-Bedroom End-of-Terrace Residence | Fully Renovated in 2024 | BER B2 | Excellent Condition Throughout\n\nKeith McLoughlin of Sheehy Meares Real Estate is delighted to bring to the market this superb four-bedroom end-of-terrace, two-storey residence, presented in pristine condition and ideally located at 23 Abbeyfield, Ballaghaderreen, Co. Roscommon.\nThis impressive home underwent an extensive renovation by its current owners in early 2024, with significant investment in insulation, heating, plumbing, electrical works and interior finishes. The property now boasts a BER rating of B2, offering excellent energy efficiency, comfort and potentially qualifying purchasers for a green mortgage, subject to lender criteria.\nThe renovation works included the installation of a new kitchen, bathrooms and flooring throughout, together with comprehensive insulation and heating upgrades. The result is a bright, spacious and beautifully presented family home, ready for immediate occupation.\n\nRenovation & Energy Efficiency\nThe property underwent extensive insulation upgrades in February 2024, including 400mm of attic insulation, fully lagged pipework and insulated water tanks. Ceilings and partition walls were insulated with 200mm of insulation, while the external walls were upgraded with 50mm Cosy Board insulation and cavity insulation beads.\nThe plumbing and heating system was extensively upgraded, including the installation of a new condensing boiler and multilayer pipework throughout. Two thermostats provide independent upstairs and downstairs heating controls, allowing for improved comfort and efficient energy management.\nA 150-litre Cyclone hot water cylinder was also installed, with provision for future solar upgrades. All electrical works were carried out by a qualified and certified electrician.\nThese improvements, together with the property's B2 energy rating, offer buyers the benefit of a modern, energy-efficient home with much of the major renovation work already completed.\n\nAccommodation\nThe ground-floor accommodation is bright, spacious and thoughtfully laid out to accommodate modern family living.\nA welcoming, bright tiled entrance hallway leads to an impressive open-plan kitchen and dining area, featuring a newly fitted kitchen with ample storage and workspace. Double sliding patio doors provide excellent natural light and direct access to the rear patio and garden, creating an ideal setting for everyday family living and entertaining.\nThe beautifully presented sitting room features an attractive media wall incorporating a modern electric fire, providing an inviting space for relaxation. Large windows allow natural light to flood the room, while French doors connect seamlessly with the adjoining kitchen and dining area.\nA further generously proportioned living room offers valuable additional accommodation, ideal as a second reception room, family room, home office or children's playroom.\nA separate utility room provides convenient laundry facilities and additional storage, while a guest W.C. completes the ground-floor accommodation.\nThe first floor comprises four bedrooms, including a master bedroom benefiting from its own ensuite bathroom. A well-appointed family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms, with both bathrooms having been upgraded as part of the extensive renovation works.\n\nExterior\nTo the front of the property, a spacious tarmacadam driveway provides ample off-street parking, complemented by a lawn area and attractive boundary walls.\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a private enclosed garden, laid mainly in lawn with a concrete patio area accessed directly from the kitchen and dining room. Concrete panel boundary fencing provides privacy, while the patio offers an excellent space for outdoor dining, entertaining and family enjoyment.\nThe property's end-of-terrace position provides the additional benefit of side access to the rear garden.\n\nLocation\nAbbeyfield is a well-established residential development conveniently located within walking distance of Ballaghaderreen town centre and its many amenities, including shops, supermarkets, schools, restaurants, cafés, sporting facilities and leisure amenities.\nThe property is also located less than a twenty-minute drive from Ireland West Airport Knock, while convenient access to the N5 provides excellent road connections to Castlebar and surrounding areas.\nBallaghaderreen offers an excellent range of local services and recreational facilities, making this an attractive location for families, first-time buyers and those seeking a modern, energy-efficient home within easy reach of everyday amenities.\nViewing\nHaving undergone extensive renovation in 2024 and benefiting from a B2 BER rating, this superb four-bedroom residence offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious, modern and beautifully finished family home requiring no immediate works.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended and can be arranged by contacting Keith McLoughlin of Sheehy Meares Real Estate.\n"
